307748_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PehhcNYUsmwQ7kNvwGKuYkm&_nc_oc=Ado_bsogyP1pRGhnjexm5nKzxOKgJn_v16vd4Pbrg6yb-Twrpmr1RFzJaE9aiTiXd78&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af3NEIOynCxJ880lyBS4rDbTRtKCi8dBWgcIJwvwUte-9A&oe=69EF4F70"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Space Control", "keywords": ["Aliens", "Cartoon", "Sandbox", "Physics", "Space"], "long_description": "You've been abducted by an intergalactic megacorporation, Glorpo Inc! Work off your debt with your alien crew - abduct new recruits, take care of alien babies and cook up some questionable space snacks!\n\n# Have fun with physics!\nPull, tug, bounce and throw around all kinds of aliens, gadgets, and thingamajigs! (almost) Everything is interactable!\n{1980053469586391}\n# Weird jobs in a unique episodic narrative!\nAbduct new recruits in the Abductorium, take care of alien babies at the Daycare and cook up some questionable space snacks at the GlorpoVision Music festival!\n{2283999592083928}\n# Meet your alien crew!\nGo on wild adventures with Melody, Widgett and Zorgle - Your friendly space companions on this corporate adventure!\n{884349157679414}\n# An immersive, whimsically dystopian world!\nEnjoy cartoony environments inspired by the absurdity of beloved shows like Futurama and Rick&Morty!\n{1982018095715483}", "short_description": "You've been abducted by an intergalactic megacorporation, Glorpo Inc! Work off your debt with your alien crew - abduct new recruits, take care of alien babies and cook up some questionable space snacks!"}]}, "developer_name": "MoonMonster Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://moonmonster.be/SpaceControl_PrivacyPolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "MoonMonster Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.moonmonster.be/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_categ